# xdice

## notice

The get_rand function in xdice depends on platform-specific implementations. Each platform must provide and link its own get_rand implementation.

xdice provides a weak default get_rand symbol. Platforms should override it with their platform-specific implementation.

## A note about licensing

This crate is based on the upstream `open-dice` repository (https://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/open-dice/).

## build

```bash
cargo build
cargo build --target aarch64-unknown-linux-musl
cargo build --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl
cargo build --no-default-features --features std --target aarch64-unknown-linux-musl
cargo build --features nostd --target aarch64-unknown-linux-musl
```